# --- Wind Whispers (WB33): absorbs Evasive Flow's Advantage — it reuses EVASIVE_FLOW_OPENING (kept).
@loca h64279279ga897g3b4bgc173gcc1156e709e0 You can sense movement in the air. Attack Rolls against you have Disadvantage, your next unarmed attack has Advantage, and when an enemy's melee attack misses you, you strike back with an unarmed attack.
@file Spell_Shout
@set Shout_Arcana_Card_Spell_WindWhispers SpellProperties "ApplyStatus(SELF,WIND_WHISPERS,100,1);ApplyStatus(SELF,EVASIVE_FLOW_OPENING,100,1);"

