@loca h456b6976gfa1cg7d54geb90g1660c0e4606b The wind flows through your hands. Your unarmed attacks deal an additional [1] against enemies that aren't <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ARCANA_WINDSWEPT">Windswept</LSTag>.
