# --- Ready: Gale Deflection (WB32): also an ally within 3 m. Anchor: vanilla Interrupt_FightingStyle_Protection
# (scope Nearby, Ally(context.Target, context.Observer), DistanceToEntityGreaterThan(_, context.ObserverPosition, context.Target)).
@loca hcfea4405g7556g969dg0f13gdb93207a863d Use your reaction to reduce the damage of a ranged weapon attack against you or an ally within [1] by 1d10 + your Dexterity <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier">Modifier</LSTag> + your Arcana level. If the damage is reduced to 0, you can hurl the missile back at your attacker, who becomes <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ARCANA_WINDSWEPT">Windswept</LSTag>.
@loca h402ace5bgf1e8g2fe1gf6e4g220b7505458b Reduce the damage of a ranged weapon attack against you or an ally within [1] by 1d10 + your Dexterity <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier">Modifier</LSTag> + your Arcana level. If the damage is reduced to 0, you can hurl the missile back at your attacker.
@file Interrupt
@set Interrupt_Arcana_Reaction_GaleDeflection InterruptContextScope "Nearby"
@set Interrupt_Arcana_Reaction_GaleDeflection DescriptionParams "Distance(3)"
@set Interrupt_Arcana_Reaction_GaleDeflection Conditions "IsAbleToReact(context.Observer) and IsRangedWeaponAttack() and (Self(context.Target,context.Observer) or (Ally(context.Target,context.Observer) and not DistanceToEntityGreaterThan(3, context.ObserverPosition, context.Target))) and not HasStatus('SG_Polymorph_BeastShape') and not AnyEntityIsItem()"
@file Passive
@set Arcana_Passive_GaleDeflection DescriptionParams "Distance(3)"
@file Status_BOOST
@set GALE_DEFLECTION_READY DescriptionParams "Distance(3)"

# --- Be the Leaf (WB21, WB40): Intelligence instead of Wisdom.
@loca h80210a1ag08f6gf70fgdf96g821b0e1e8847 Your reflexes are as effective as armour. You add your Intelligence <LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier">Modifier</LSTag> to your Armour Class.
@file Passive
@set Arcana_Passive_BetheLeaf Boosts "ACOverrideFormula(10,true,Dexterity,Intelligence)"
